<title>FINLAND: Neste to supply solar power system to IKEA.</title>
<headline>Neste to supply solar power system to IKEA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish energy group Neste Oy said on Wednesday the Swedish arm of its advanced power systems unit (NAPS) would supply Swedish furniture group IKEA with a solar power system for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;NAPS Sweden Ab is constructing a 50-kilowatt grid-connected roof-top solar energy system with IKEA of Sweden,&quot; Neste said in a statement.</p>
<p>The system, to be installed at IKEA premises at Almhult, Sweden, would consist of 450 solar panel modules and would include a data-logging and display system, Neste said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
